  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "喂！超Z隊的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF018D85005A968A76843002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快來幫忙我助人啦。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一定會說「好」對吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB4F865E6B5FD9621152A94EBA55663002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E005B9A67038AAA300C597D300D5C0D5427FF1F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88597D3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實，那邊的下水道\n會傳出哀嚎聲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE6FF0C90A3908A76844E0B6C349053000A670350B351FA54C0568E80723002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我不能不調查一下，\n但我聽說下水道有可怕的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n幽靈屬性寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662114E0D80FD4E0D8ABF67E54E004E0BFF0C000A4F466211807D8AAA4E0B6C349053670953EF6015768400100001BE00000A5E7D97485C6C60275BF653EF592220262026001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我想讓烏羽先生\n認可的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來給我幫個小忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621160F38B9370CF7FBD5148751F000A8A8D53EF768400100003110000FF01014F6059B34F867D6662115E6B500B5C0F5FD93002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我先說我不是在害怕喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151488AAA62114E0D662F57285BB360155594FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳不是很強嗎？為了這座城市\n就不要囉囉嗦嗦了，來幫忙啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E0D662F5F885F3755CEFF1F70BA4E8690195EA757CE5E02000A5C314E0D898156C956C955E655E64E86FF0C4F865E6B5FD95566FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們要調查下水道裡面囉！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳走前面啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501189818ABF67E54E0B6C34905388E1976256C9FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B38D70524D976255663002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不是在害怕喔！\n比較強的傢伙打頭陣比較好吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D662F57285BB360155594FF01000A6BD48F035F37768450A24F196253982D96636BD48F03597D5427FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯，\n算是沒什麼問題……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF0C000A7B97662F6C924EC09EBC554F984C20262026001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯？那個是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF1F90A3500B662F20262026001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗚咿咿咿咿！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55DA54BF54BF54BF54BFFF01FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來這些寶可夢\n在睡覺的樣子……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8690194E9B5BF653EF5922000A5728776189BA76846A235B50202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有在恐怖故事裡聽過……\n那是叫做死神棺的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670957286050601665454E8B88E1807D904E20262026000A90A3662F53EB505A6B7B795E68FA76845BF653EF59223002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說牠好像會把人\n關進自己的身體裡……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA7260597D50CF6703628A4EBA000A95DC903281EA5DF176848EAB9AD488E120262026001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總、總之發動攻擊，\n把這些傢伙趕走吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D30017E3D4E4B767C52D5653B64CAFF0C000A628A90194E9B50A24F198D958D705427FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之給我調查地下水道吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
