      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6C34905388E1000A90846B98755984576B7B795E68FA76846C23606F202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好刺眼！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D523A773CFF01FF0100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你還好嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F609084597D55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "發生了什麼事？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767C751F4E864EC09EBC4E8BFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……說來真不好意思，\n我發現了在密阿雷很稀有的寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是死神棺，就興奮了起來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620268AAA4F86771F4E0D597D610F601DFF0C000A6211767C73FE4E8657285BC6963F96F75F887A00670976845BF653EF59222026202600100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F6B7B795E68FAFF0C5C318208596E4E868D774F86300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我忘我地又吵又鬧，\n好像讓死神棺覺得很吵。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115FD86211573053C8543553C89B27FF0C000A597D50CF8B936B7B795E68FA89BA5F975F885435300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我就被發怒的\n死神棺吞進去了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562115C3188AB767C60127684000A6B7B795E68FA541E903253BB4E86300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "躺起來實在太舒服，\n我差點就要熟睡下去了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EBA8D774F865BE65728592A8212670DFF0C000A62115DEE9EDE5C318981719F77614E0B53BB4E86300200100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之非常謝謝你們\n把我放出來！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D4E4B975E5E388B1D8B1D4F605011000A628A6211653E51FA4F86FF0100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可能有人被關在\n死神棺的體內。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n快給我去找死神棺。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF80FD67094EBA88AB95DC5728000A6B7B795E68FA76849AD45167300200100001BE01000A5FEB7D66621153BB627E6B7B795E68FA3002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喲，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幹得挺好的嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B2FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E795F97633A597D7684561BFF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "發出哀嚎的人也沒事，真是太好了。\n我們做了件好事耶！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767C51FA54C0568E76844EBA4E5F6C924E8BFF0C771F662F592A597D4E863002000A62115011505A4E864EF6597D4E8B8036FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能為密阿雷做上好事，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也很開心吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD70BA5BC6963F96F7505A4E0A597D4E8BFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F5F88958B5FC35427FF01001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可要感謝\n跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳搭話的我喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF8981611F8B1D000A8DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B3642D8A717684621155943002001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你後面……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605F8C9762202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你會被吞下去喔",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60670388AB541E4E0B53BB55940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF1F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗚呀～～～～！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 2972,
